        B1["IP 164.91.236.18<br/>OS Linux 2.6<br/>DNS rbps-dev3-sve-vip.ecommnp.rpg"] --> B2["sign: no OS marker;<br/>segments rbps, dev3, sve, vip;<br/>vip is a marker"]
